=== REASONING ===
1. 6 panels query battery_snapshots columns with NO signal equivalent (health_score,
   degradation_pct, capacity_kwh, cycle_count). Per ADR-002 (no fabricated data), these
   are REMOVED: rawSql replaced with SELECT NULL, title suffixed "(Unavailable)".
2. Est. Range → EstBatteryRange (value_num, miles). Unit changed to lengthmi.
3. Avg Cell Temp → renamed "Max Module Temp", signal ModuleTempMax. This is NOT an average
   — thresholds updated (green<40, orange 40-50, red>50 °C).
4. 3 time-series panels querying battery_snapshots → REMOVED (no signal equivalent).
5. Panel 10 (Charge Level Distribution) uses v_charging_sessions — not a dropped table → KEEP.
6. 5 panels query charging_telemetry (also dropped). All rewritten to signal_log pivot pattern:
   - Cell Voltage: BrickVoltageMax/Min with $__timeGroup(created_at, '1h')
   - Module Temp Range: ModuleTempMax/Min with $__timeGroup(created_at, '1h')
   - Pack V&I: PackVoltage/PackCurrent with $__timeGroup(created_at, '1h')
   - BMS & Isolation: BMSState(last/str), IsolationResistance(last/num), LifetimeEnergyUsed(last/num), BatteryHeaterOn(last/bool→CASE)
   - Powershare: PowershareStatus(last/str), PowershareType(last/str), PowershareInstantaneousPowerKW(last/num), PowershareHoursLeft(last/num)
     with HAVING filter to exclude empty rows.
7. Added 3 NEW panels from available signals per prompt instruction:
   - Battery Level stat (BatteryLevel, value_num, %)
   - Energy Remaining stat (EnergyRemaining, value_num, kWh)
   - Battery Level & Energy Over Time timeseries (both signals)
8. Grid layout reorganized: useful panels in top rows, unavailable panels pushed to bottom.
9. home.json panel 5: health_score → REMOVED, title "Battery Health (Unavailable)".

Performance rules followed:
  ✅ All time-series queries use created_at BETWEEN $__timeFrom() AND $__timeTo()
  ✅ All queries include signal IN (...) filter for chunk pruning
  ✅ Time-series use $__timeGroup(created_at, '1h') or '5m' for table panels
  ✅ Single-value panels use ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT 1
  ✅ Text/enum signals use last(value_str, created_at) — NOT MAX(value_text)
  ✅ Boolean signals use last(value_bool, created_at)

